# The registry inlines the literal bytes of every text file under registry/ into
# the JSON payloads the CLI installs from. If the working tree were allowed to
# follow the platform (core.autocrlf=true on Windows, LF on a Linux CI builder),
# the same commit would serve CRLF locally and LF from Vercel — different bytes,
# different checksums, for the same declared item. Pin LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.bin binary
*.glb binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary

# Generated; collapse in diffs and PR reviews.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
